  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna sadeeso ka Hosheani, ilmi Eela, hayyu Israeli tahe, Hezekiani, ilmi Ahazi hayyu Yuda tahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafasi ganni isaa diddami shani, duuba inni ganna diddami sagali Yerusalemu keesa lafa mohate. Had'a isaa maqaani Abiya, isiini dubra Zekaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni faana ababo isaa Daudi gula bahe, waan AABBO Waaqa gammachiisa tolche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 21.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inni fulla Waaqa d'ara iti kad'atani ta gaareeni balleese, d'akhaye old'ad'aabani ch'ach'abse, akheekha waaqa Asherale ch'ach'abse. Inni ammalle bofa Musani sibiila diimani mid'aase, ka Nehushtani jed'ani, ch'ach'abse. Worri Israeli duri bofa suni hit'aana aarsefi guddise, haga guyya ch'ach'absani suni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiani AABBO Waaqa Israeli d'ugeefate; worri Yuda, haguma d'alate, taka isa duraafi eegi isaale hayyu akasi inhoranne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni taka AABBO Waaqa lakise seera isaa inch'absine. Ammo seera AABBO Waaqi Musaa kenne ch'ufa akuma dansaa guute. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi AABBO Waaqi isa woliini jiraate, waan inni tolche ch'ufa keesati isa qarqaare, huji isaa eebiseefi. Inni hayyu Ashuruti garagale, hojachuufi dide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni worra Filisti dabsate, qutuma worrale balleese, dira didiqafi gugurdale, dira Gazatifi lafa d'aatu jirtule.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna afreeso ka Hezekiani lafa mohate, ka ammalle ganna ganna torbeeso Hosheani lafa Israeli mohate, hayyuuni Shalmanesani lafa Ashuru d'ufe, lafa Israeli had'e, dira Samaria marse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna sadi Samaria marsani, eege dabsatani; gaafasi ganna jaeeso ka Hezekiani lafa mohate, ammalle ganna sagaleeso ka Hosheani lafa mohate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyuuni Ashuru worra Israeli boojie, ka gari Hala geese, ka gari galaana Habori, ka lafa Gozani, geese, ka gaari dira worra Medi geese achi qubsise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti dira Samaria nyaapi dabsateefi waan worri Israeli AABBO Waaqa isaani lakise, wold'aqisa duri woliini tolfatani ch'abse, seera Musani hojattuuni AABBO Waaqa worraa kenne guutu dideefi. Worri waan suni inch'aqamne yokhaani diqole inguunne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worri Ashuru Yerusalemu naasise",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna kud'ani ka Hezekiani lafa mohate, Senakeribuni, hayyuuni Ashuru, dira Yuda ka jabeesani jaarani had'e dabsate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Hezekiani qonqo gara Senakeribu, ka Lakishi jiru, erge waan jed'eeni, Anini ya woyake, na inhad'ini, naraa deebii, duuba waan atini feetu ch'ufa sii baasa. Hayyuuni Ashuru qonqo gara Hezekia deebise waan jed'eeni, Qarsi kilo kud'anitifi worqi kilo kuma toko naa baasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiani qarsi Mana Waaqatifi mana hayyu keesa jirtu ch'ufa iti erge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle inni worqi balbala mana Waaqati dad'abaniifi ta inni mikhikila balbalati naqele ch'ufa guure ergeefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani hayyuuni Ashuru duula muumme inqamne dira Lakishiti kaase, Yerusalemuti erge, aka Hezekia had'u abbotiini duula suni worra gugurda sadi, ka qara askarti isaa ch'ufa harkaa qabu. Worri Yerusalemuni bahe, kara worri woya mid'aasu keesa tau, ka d'aatu fulla bisaani haro keesa diratini yaaniti naanae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri hayyu Hezekia yaame, hojattuuni isaa, nami sadi, worrati gadi bahe: Worri sunini, Eliakimu, ilma Hilkia, ka mana hayyuuti gudda; Shebna, ka tatabe hayyu t'aafufi; Yoa, ilma Asafu, ka waan t'aafani olkayani ch'ufa harkaa qabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi jara Ashuru guddaani toko waan jed'eeni, Waan isani Hezekiani jettani, Hayyuuni Ashuru waan jed'e, Maaniti akana garaa si jabeese ufi si d'ugefachise? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini waan dubbi tanteetiini oguma woraana dabsatu seeta? Amma eentu si qarqaara, mala keeti ka atini hayyu Ashuru didde iti gargalte? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini mala keeti waan worri Misiri si qarqaaru seeta, ammo mali sunini nama ilaadu ule sehe, ta yo inni lafati d'aabu ch'abt'e harka woraantu fakaata. Aki hayyuuni Misiri nama isa d'abatu tolchu akasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo yo atini, AABBO Waaqa keenna d'aabanna nani jette nami fulla waaqa iti kad'atani sorio irati baasani balleese Hezekianiti? Ka ammalle garagale worra Yerusalemutifi ka Yudatini, Fulla sorio irati baasani ta Yerusalemu ch'allaati Waaqa kad'ad'a jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma kooti hayyu kenna ka Ashurutini waan takaa woliini taha: Anini fardoole kuma lama sii kenna, yo atini dandeete nama hagasi ka yaabatu naa kennite! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini akami dandeete hojattu abba kiyya ta guddinna womaatu inqamne d'owarta, ka ufiftu waan worri Misiri gaariifi askarti farda sii kennu seeta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini waan anini qarqaarsa AABBO Waaqa male lafa teesani had'e balleese seeta? AABBO Waaqati, Beeni, lafa suni had'i balleesi nani jed'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Eliakimufi Shebnafi Yoani waan namicha gudda kaaniini jed'ani, AABBO, afaani Aramutini nuti dubbad'i, ind'ageenna, afaani Ebrania nuti indubbatini nami d'aatu teenna ch'iisu kunini ch'ufti nu d'agaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan jed'eeni, Isani waan hayyichi Ashuru isanifi hayyu keesani ch'alla qonqo tana iti erge seetani? Hiyo akasiniti, anini gumi arma teteetu tana, ta eegi tana finch'aanifi udaani ufi akuma keesani sooratuti dubbachuni jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
